hadiths[7]{hadithnumber,text}:
"50","[AI-translation] Mera Aala Rab pak hai. [Sajde mein kahe]"
"51","[AI-translation] Ae Allah, ae hamare Rab, Tu pak hai; teri hi tareef hai; ae Allah, mujhe bakhsh de. [Sajde mein kahe]"
"52","[AI-translation] Bahut pak, bahut muqaddas; farishton aur Ruh [Jibrail] ka Rab. [Sajde mein kahe]"
"53","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Tere liye sajda kiya, Tujh par iman laya, tere supurd hua; mere chehre ne use sajda kiya jis ne use paida kiya, surat di, us ki samaat aur basarat kholi; behtareen Khaliq Allah babarkat hai. [Sajde mein kahe]"
"54","[AI-translation] Jabarut, malkut, kibriya aur azmat wale [Allah] ki paki. [Sajde mein kahe]"
"55","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Mere sare gunah bakhsh de: chhote-bade, pehle-peeche, khule-chhipe. [Sajde mein kahe]"
"56","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Tere ghazab se teri raza ki, teri saza se tere maaf karne ki panah chahta hun; Tujhse teri hi panah chahta hun; teri tareef gin nahin sakta; Tu waisa hi hai jaisi Tune apni tareef ki. [Sajde aur witr mein padhe]"
